import OptionalSamplingRC.Basic

/-! # Optional sampling for right-continuous supermartingales

Root module of the `optional-sampling-rc` package. The development lives in
`OptionalSamplingRC.Basic`: optional-sampling inequalities for nonnegative
right-continuous supermartingales indexed by `ℝ≥0`, evaluated at arbitrary
stopping times, together with an exponential-discounting construction that
produces such supermartingales from a martingale-problem hypothesis.
-/
